moon-cose
Copyright 2026 Hhsqoo

This product includes a design port of message structures from google/coset
(https://github.com/google/coset), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
The port covers COSE header maps, Sig_structure, MAC_structure, Enc_structure,
and the tagged array layout of COSE_Sign1, COSE_Sign, COSE_Mac0, and
COSE_Encrypt0. Cryptography and CBOR encoding are not taken from coset.

This product depends on 2515050242/cbor 0.1.2
(https://github.com/2515050242/moonbit-cbor-RFC-8949-CBOR-Concise-Binary-Object-Representation),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

This product depends on cc06b/mooncry 0.95.0
(https://github.com/cc06b/mooncry), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
Ed25519, ECDSA P-256, HMAC-SHA-256/384/512, AES-GCM, AES-KW, AES-CCM, and
ChaCha20-Poly1305 are called from that library. P-384, P-521, and ECDH are
not exposed by that version and are not reimplemented here.

Test vectors under testdata/cose-wg/ are from cose-wg/Examples
(https://github.com/cose-wg/Examples), dedicated to the public domain under
the Unlicense. See testdata/cose-wg/UNLICENSE.
